@OrderIntake.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5048

### List the first page of orders
GET {{OrderIntake.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Create an order
POST {{OrderIntake.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"externalReference": "PO-2026-14",
	"customerName": "Northwind Trading",
	"customerEmail": "orders@northwind.example",
	"currency": "ZAR",
	"notes": "Deliver before month end",
	"items": [
		{
			"sku": "SKU-1",
			"name": "Widget",
			"quantity": 3,
			"unitPrice": 16.50
		}
	]
}

### Change an order status (replace the ID with one returned by create/list)
PATCH {{OrderIntake.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"status": "Confirmed"
}
###
